post.summary:
ReindexLibrarySeekIndex kicks a background job that re-scans the library
then rebuilds the seek index of every un-indexed file. Returns immediately;
progress (scanning → processing, done/total) via GetSeekIndexJob.

RollbackLibrarySeekIndex kicks a background job that re-scans the library
then restores every file that has a .mkvgobak backup. Returns immediately;
progress via GetSeekIndexJob.

queued.description:
Number of orphaned items queued for enrichment. The job runs async;
the actual matched count is observable by re-listing items with
empty providerIds.
